OL,3,GNEWSARoad closures as safety measures
OL,4,Aadded near schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoad closures and traffic restrictions
OL,7,Fwill be put in place on a busy route in
OL,8,FLeicester as work takes place on a
OL,9,F#180,000 road safety scheme.
OL,11,FLeicester City Council said traffic
OL,12,Fcalming measures will be installed in
OL,13,FGleneagles Avenue, near Herrick Primary
OL,14,FSchool and English Martyrs' Catholic
OL,15,FSchool, from 17 October.
OL,17,FIt said work will include raising two
OL,18,Fpedestrian crossings to reduce vehicle
OL,19,Fspeeds and improve safety for
OL,20,Fpedestrians and schoolchildren.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
